  unitName: Floret Queen Rosetta
  unitId: 30544
  unitNumber: 822
  description: A young girl carrying the banner of the God Army. Though it is believed
    she was an ordinary human, there are no detailed records concerning this, nor
    the gods that had employed her services. The only thing that remains is the impression
    she left on others as her beautiful figure surrounded by flowers carried the
    banner of the God Army. Being a human, she was placed in the rear of the army
    when the war broke, but the humans' resistance proved too much for the God Army.
    It was then when she took up arms and made her way to the frontline, fighting
    with ferocious will.
  summonDesc: Don't worry about me.<br>Send me to the battlefield.<br>Let me show
    you what I'm capable of.
  fusionDesc: Your powers make flowers bloom.<br>You are quite a lovely person.
  evoDesc: Take a look at this flower.<br>This is the beautiful flower<br>we have
    bloomed together.
  element: 3
  rarity: 4
